 normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;;\">☝︎</span><span class=\"s1\">かほよーこ（去年のひなくりの時のです）</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">季節外れで申し訳ないです</span><span class=\"s3\">🙇‍♀️</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">9th</span><span class=\"s1\">シングル</span><span class=\"s2\">One choice</span><span class=\"s1\">が間もなく</span><span class=\"s2\">4</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s2\">19</span><span class=\"s1\">日</span><span class=\"s2\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">水</span><span class=\"s2\">)</span><span class=\"s1\">発売となります！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">表題曲の</span><span class=\"s2\">One choice</span><span class=\"s1\">の</span><span class=\"s2\">MV</span><span class=\"s1\">も本当に素敵で見ていて自然に笑顔になってしまいますよね</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span><span class=\"s1\">！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">私は何度も見返しております！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">先輩方の期別曲やカップリング曲もとっても楽しみです！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-a